{"id":"b2079cb7dec7ca43","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal.md","title":"ZFC Successor Cardinal","display":"df-zfc-successor-cardinal — ZFC Successor Cardinal","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal","aliases":["58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal","58-df-zfc-card-successor-cardinal"],"display":"df-zfc-successor-cardinal — ZFC Successor Cardinal","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-successor-cardinal</span><span>58-df-zfc-card-successor-cardinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-successor-cardinal — ZFC Successor Cardinal"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"042e025a903ae499\" href=\"?note=042e025a903ae499\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span> (cardinal parameters)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S\\)</span> (alias predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S\\)</span> (initial-cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"042e025a903ae499\" href=\"?note=042e025a903ae499\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa&lt;\\lambda \\land \\forall\\mu\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\mu&lt;\\lambda\\to \\neg\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\mu))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa&lt;\\lambda \\land \\forall\\mu\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\mu&lt;\\lambda\\to \\neg\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\mu))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Thus <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> is the least initial ordinal strictly above <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>, i.e. <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\kappa^+\">\\(\\lambda=\\kappa^+\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-card-successor-cardinal</code> is merged here.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"042e025a903ae499","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"042e025a903ae499","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S$ (initial-cardinal predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-zfc-initial-cardinal.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land \\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\lambda)\\land \\kappa<\\lambda \\land \\forall\\mu\\;(\\kappa<\\mu<\\lambda\\to \\neg\\mathrm{InitialCardinal}_S(\\mu))","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}successor\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardSuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{SuccessorCardinal}_S(\\lambda,\\kappa)","display":true},{"tex":"\\lambda","disp